INTERPRETATION
direct deform bone = referenced by Physique of a visible SMD object
ancestor-only bone = no visible vertex assigned directly, but transform can propagate to a deform bone
extra not in visible deform ancestry = cannot affect the current visible mesh through parent->child deformation alone
IMPORTANT: such extra bones may still be externally used as weapon/effect/attachment/socket nodes; this probe does not classify external engine references

